# Paranormal Analyst, "put a card you put into your graveyard this way into your hand": a card that has left the graveyard before the ability
# resolves is a new object and can't be put into the hand (CR 400.7; the ruling). Bot1's Twist Reality manifests Llanowar Elves and puts
# Lightning Bolt into the graveyard; with the Analyst's ability on the stack, Bot1 exiles its own graveyard with Tormod's Crypt, so the ability
# finds nothing: the Bolt stays in exile (with the rest of the graveyard, the sacrificed Crypt included) and Bot1's hand keeps only the Island it drew.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Paranormal Analyst
Twist Reality
Tormod's Crypt
Island
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

