Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Tormod's Crypt.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Paranormal Analyst.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Twist Reality.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Manifest dread)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Llanowar Elves | Lightning Bolt)
? Stack.Count = 1
? Bot1.Graveyard = Twist Reality; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield.Tormod's Crypt.Activate(Bot1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

